  Content: "Once home to the Klondike Thawing Machine Company, the KTM Building is
    a preserved piece of Dawson\u2019s industrial history. With its bold Boomtown
    fa\xE7ade and corrugated metal charm, this historic storefront marks a gateway
    between town and the goldfields\u2014where innovation once met icy ground and
    ambition ran deep."
